hadiths[338]{hadithnumber,text}:
"5040","Ummul-Mominin Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : das cheezen insani fitrat ka taqaza hain : munchhen kaatna, nakhun tarashna, ungliyon key jodon aur poron ko achchhi tarah dhona, dadhi puri rakhna, miswak karna, naak mein pani chadhana (aur naak ki safai karna), baghlon key baal ukhedna, sharmgaah key baal mundna, pani key sath istinja karna. Mus'ab bin Sheba (hadees key rawi) ney kaha : daswin chiz main bhool gaya. ummid hai ke wo kulli karna hoga."
"5041","Hazrat Suleman Taimi sey riwayat hai ke mainey Hazrat Talaq bin Habib ko farmatey suna, das cheezen fitri hain : miswak karna, munchhen kaatna, nakhun tarashna, ungliyon key poron aur jodon ko achchhi tarah dhona, naaf key nichey baal mundna, naak ki safai karna, kulli key barey mein mujhey shak hai."
"5042","Hazrat Talaq bin Habib ney farmaya : das cheezen (Anbiya Alaihimussalam ki) sunnat hain : miswak karna, munchhen kaatna, kulli karna, naak ki safai karna, dadhi puri rakhna, nakhun tarashna, baghlon key baal ukhedna, khatna karwana, naaf key nichey (sharmgaah) key baal mundna aur (zarurat sey farigh honey key baad) jism ka pichhla hissa dhona."
"5043","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : paanch cheezen fitri hain : khatna karna, sharmgaah key baal mundna, baghlon key baal ukhedna, nakhun tarashna aur munchhen chhoti karna. Imam Malik (Rahmatullahi Alaih) ney is (riwayat) ko mauqoof bayan kiya hai."
"5044","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : paanch cheezen fitrat aur sunnat hain : nakhun tarashna, munchhen kaatna, baghal key baal ukhedna, sharmgaah key baal mundna aur khatna karwana."
"5045","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : munchhon ko khatm karo aur dadhi ko badhney do."
"5046","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : dadhiyan rakho aur munchhen saaf karo."
"5047","Hazrat Zaid bin Arqam (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain ke mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : jo shakhs apni munchhen na kaatey wo hum mein sey nahin."
"5048","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney eik bachcha dekha jiska kuchh sar munda huwa tha aur kuchh chhod diya gaya tha. aap ney is sey mana farmaya aur farmaya : sara sar mundwao ya sara rehne do."
"5049","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mana farmaya ke aurat apna sar mundey."
"5050","Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke Allah Azza wa Jalla ney mujhey qaza sey mana farmaya hai."
"5051","Hazrat ibne-Umar Raziallahu anhuma sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney qaza sey mana farmaya hai. Abu Abdur-Rehman (Imam Nasai) ney farmaya : Yahya bin Saeed aur Muhammad bin Bishr ki hadees ziyada sahih hai."
"5052","Hazrat Waeyl bin Hujr (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke main Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaya jabkey merey (sar par) baal they. aap ney farmaya : buri baat. mainey samjha ke aap mujhey kehtey hain. phir mainey apney baal katwa liye aur aap key paas aaya. aap ney mujh sey farmaya : mainey tumhen nahin kaha tha, lekin ye behtar hai."
"5053","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key baal ghunaghriyaal they, na ghunaghriyaal aur na bilkul seedhey, kaanon aur kandhon key darmiyan (lataktey) they."
"5054","Hazrat Humaid bin Abdur-Rehman Himyari sey riwayat hai ke main eik aadmi sey mila jo Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key sath raha tha jaisa Abu-Hurera chaar saal aap key sath rahey. unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney hamen mana farmaya tha ke hum mein sey koi roz kanghi karey."
"5055","Hazrat Abdullah bin Mughaffal (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney eik eik din chhod kar kanghi karney sey mana farmaya hai."
"5056","Hazrat Hasan Basri sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney eik eik din chhod kar kanghi karney sey mana farmaya hai."
"5057","Hazrat Hasan Basri aur Muhammad bin Sireen kehtey hain ke (baalon mein) kanghi eik eik din chhod kar karni chahiye."
"5058","Hazrat Abdullah bin Shaqeeq sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key sahaba mein sey eik aadmi Misr mein governer tha. uskey paas uska eik sahabi aaya to us ney usey paraganada sar aur bikherey huye baalon wala paaya. us ney kaha : main tumhen pareshan-haal kyon dekh raha hun jabkey tum ameer ho? unhoney farmaya : Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) hamen aaraam-talbi sey mana farmatey they. ham ney puchha : aaraam-talbi kya hai? unhoney farmaya unhoney farmaya : roz kanghi karna."
"5059","Ummul-Mominin Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) dayen sey shuru karna pasand farmatey they. wo dayen haath sey letey aur dayen haath sey detey aur apney tamam kaamon mein dayen sey shuru karna pasand farmatey they."
"5060","Hazrat Bara (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke mainey surkh hulla mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey badh kar kisi ko haseen nahin dekha jabkey aap key baal kandhon tak aatey they."
"5061","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key baal aadhey kaanon tak aatey they."
"5062","Hazrat Bara ney farmaya : mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey badh kar surkh hulla mein kisi aadmi ko haseen nahin dekha. unhoney farmaya : aur mainey aap ki zulfen dekhin jo kandhon key qareeb tak aati thin."
"5063","Hazrat Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke tum mujhey kis ki qiraat par padhney ka hukm detey ho? mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko sattar sey kuchh upar suraten sunain jabkey Zaid do chotiyon waley (bachchey) they, ladkon key sath kheltey they."
"5064","Hazrat Abu-Waeyl sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat ibne-Masood ney hamen khutba diya aur farmaya : tum mujhey Zaid bin Sabit ki qiraat par padhney ka hukm kaisey detey ho jabkey mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key munh sey sattar sey kuchh upar suraten padhin jabkey Zaid ladkon key sath do chotiyon wala (bachcha) tha."
"5065","Ziyad bin Husain apney baap sey riwayat kartey hain ke jab wo Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas Madina mein aaye to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney un sey farmaya : merey qareeb aao. wo aap key qareeb aaye to aap ney apna haath unki choti par rakha, phir haath phera phir haath phera aur un par (haath pher kar) unka naam liya aur unkey liye dua farmai."
"5066","Hazrat Waeyl bin Hujr sey riwayat hai ke main Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaya jabkey merey (sar par) lambi zulfen thin. aap ney farmaya : buri baat. aur mainey samjha ke aap mujhey kehtey hain. phir main gaya aur apney baal katwa liye. aap ney farmaya : mainey tumhen nahin kaha tha, aur ye behtar hai."
"5067","Hazrat Ruwaifey bin Sabit sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : aey Ruwaifey ! shayad tum merey baad lambi zindagi pao. phir logon ko khabar kar dena ke jo shakhs apni dadhi mein girah lagaye, ya taant galey mein latkaye, ya janwar key gobar ya haddi sey istinja karey to Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) us sey bari hain."
"5068","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib apney baap sey, wo apney dada sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney safed baal nochney sey mana farmaya hai."
"5069","Hazrat Abu-Salma sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Abu-Hurera ney farmaya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya doosri sanad sey bhi aisi hi riwayat hai : Hazrat Abu-Salma bin Abdur-Rehman ney unhen bataya ke Hazrat Abu-Hurera sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Yahudi aur Nasrani (baal) nahin rangtey, tum unki mukhalifat karo."
"5070","Hazrat Abu-Salma Hazrat Abu-Hurera sey, wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey aisi hi (riwayat) bayan kartey hain."
"5071","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : be-shak Yahud-o-Nasaara (baal) nahin rangtey. lihaza unki mukhalifat karo aur (baal) rango."
"5072","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke be-shak Yahud-o-Nasaara (baal) nahin rangtey. lihaza tum unki mukhalifat karo."
"5073","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : safed baal badal do aur Yahudiyon sey mushabehat ikhtiyar na karo."
"5074","Hazrat Zuber (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke safed baal badal do aur Yahudiyon sey mushabehat ikhtiyar na karo. aur dono ghair-mehfooz hain."
"5075","Hazrat ibne-Abbas marfooan riwayat kartey hain ke unhoney farmaya : aakhri zamaney mein eik qom is kaaley (rang) sey khizaab karegi jaisa kabutaron key seeney (hotey hain). wo jannat ki khushbu bhi nahin paengey."
"5076","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Fath-Makka key din Abu-Quhafa ko laya gaya jabkey unkey sar aur dadhi saghamah (safed ghaas) ki tarah safed they. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : isey kisi chiz sey badal do aur kaaley sey bacho."
"5077","Hazrat Abu-Zar (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke safed baalon ko badalney ki behtareen chizen mehndi aur wasma hain."
"5078","Hazrat Abdullah bin Buraida Hazrat Abu-Aswad Dili sey, wo Hazrat Abu-Zar sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : be-shak safed baalon ko badalney ki behtareen chizen mehndi aur wasma hain."
"5079","Hazrat Abdullah bin Buraida Hazrat Abu-Aswad Dili sey, wo Hazrat Abu-Zar sey riwayat kartey hain ke mainey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : be-shak safed baalon ko badalney ki behtareen chizen mehndi aur wasma hain."
"5080","Hazrat Abdullah bin Buraida sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : be-shak safed baalon ko badalney ki behtareen chizen mehndi aur wasma hain. Jareeri aur Kahmas ney mukhalifat ki hai."
"5081","Hazrat Abdullah bin Buraida sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : be-shak safed baalon ko badalney ki behtareen chizen mehndi aur wasma hain."
"5082","Hazrat Abdullah bin Buraida sey riwayat hai ke unhen ye baat pahunchi hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : be-shak safed baalon ko badalney ki behtareen chizen mehndi aur wasma hain."
"5083","Hazrat Abu-Rimsa sey riwayat hai ke main aur merey waalid Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaye jabkey aap ney apni dadhi mehndi sey rangi hui thi."
"5084","Hazrat Abu-Rimsa Raziallahu anhu sey riwayat hai ke main Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaya aur mainey aap ko dekha ke aap ney apni dadhi peeley (rang) sey rangi hui thi."
"5085","Hazrat Zaid bin Aslam sey riwayat hai ke mainey Hazrat ibne-Umar ko apni dadhi khaluq sey peeli kartey dekha. mainey kaha : aey Abu Abdur-Rehman ! tum apni dadhi khaluq sey peeli kartey ho? unhoney farmaya : mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko apni dadhi is sey peeli kartey dekha hai. aur khushbuon mein sey aap ko is sey badh kar koi pasand nahin thi. aur aap apney kapdey bhi is sey rangtey they yahan tak ke amama bhi."
"5086","Hazrat Qatada sey riwayat hai ke unhoney Hazrat Anas sey puchha : kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) khizaab kartey they? unhoney farmaya : iski naubat nahin aai. aap key sirf kanpation par chand (safed baal) they."
"5087","Hazrat Qatada Hazrat Anas sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) khizaab nahin kartey they. aap key honthon key nichey thodi key paas mamuli, kanpation mein mamuli aur sar mein mamuli (safedi) thi."
"5088","Hazrat Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) das khaslaton ko napasand farmatey they : peela rang yani khaluq, safed baal badalna, izar latkana, soney ki angoothi pehenna, pason sey khelna, ghair-mehram key liye zeenat zahir karna aur muawwizaaat key baghair jhaad-phoonk, taweez latkana, ghair-mahal mein paani zaya karna aur bachchey ki doodh kharab karna magar usey haram nahin kaha."
"5089","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke eik aurat ney Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki taraf khat dey kar haath badhaya. aap ney apna haath khinch liya. us ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! mainey aap ki taraf khat dey kar haath badhaya tha magar aap ney usey nahin liya. aap ney farmaya : mujhey malum nahin tha ke ye aurat ka haath hai ya mard ka? us ney kaha : aurat ka haath hai. aap ney farmaya : agar tum agar aurat hoti to apney nakhun mehndi sey badal leti."
"5090","Hazrat Karima sey riwayat hai ke mainey suna ke eik aurat ney Hazrat Aaisha sey mehndi key khizaab key barey mein puchha. unhoney farmaya : is mein koi harj nahin. lekin main isey napasand karti hun kyonkey merey mehboob (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) uski bu ko napasand farmatey they, yani Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam)."
"5091","Hazrat Abu Al-Husain Haisam bin Shafi sey riwayat hai ke unhoney farmaya : main aur mera eik sathi jo Abu-Aamir kehlata tha, jo Ma'afir mein sey tha, Baitul-Maqdas mein namaz key liye nikley. unka qissago Azd mein sey eik aadmi tha jisey Abu-Raihana kaha jata tha, jo sahaba mein sey they Abu Al-Husain ney kaha : mera sathi mujh sey masjid mein pehley pahunch gaya, phir main us tak pahuncha aur uskey pehlu mein beth gaya. us ney kaha : kya tum ney Abu-Raihana ka qissa paaya? mainey kaha : nahin. us ney kaha : mainey usey kehtey suna : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney das (chizon) sey mana farmaya hai : daanton ko nokeela karney, godney, baal nochney, mard ka baghair kapdey key mard sey lipat kar soney, aurat ka baghair kapdey key aurat sey lipat kar soney, mard ka apney kapdon key nichey ajamiyon ki tarah resham laganey, ya apney kandhon par ajamiyon ki tarah resham laganey, loot maar, cheetey ki khaal par sawaar honey aur anguthiyan pehenney sey siwa hukmaran key."
"5092","Hazrat Saeed bin Musaiyab sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Muawiya ney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney zoar (jaali baal laganey) sey mana farmaya hai."
"5093","Hazrat Saeed Maqburi sey riwayat hai ke mainey Hazrat Muawiya bin Abi Sufiyan ko mimbar par dekha jabkey unkey haath mein aurton key baalon ka eik guchha tha. unhoney farmaya : musalman aurton ko kya ho gaya hai ke wo aisa karti hain? mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : jo aurat apney sar mein (jaali baal) badhaye kyonkey jo aurat apney sar mein aisa baal badhaye jo uska nahin to wo jhoot hai jo wo us mein badhati hai."
"5094","Hazrat Hisham bin Urwa apni biwi Fatima sey, wo Hazrat Asma bint-e-Abi Bakar sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney baal jodne wali aur judwane wali par laanat farmai hai."
"5095","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney baal jodne wali, judwane wali, godney wali aur gudwane wali par laanat farmai hai. Waleed bin Abi Hisham ney isey mursal bayan kiya hai."
"5096","Hazrat Naafey sey riwayat hai ke unhen ye baat pahunchi hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney baal jodne wali, judwane wali, godney wali aur gudwane wali par laanat farmai hai."
"5097","Hazrat Safiyya bint-e-Shaiba sey, wo Hazrat Aaisha sey riwayat karti hain ke unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Allah baal jodne wali aur judwane wali par laanat farmaye."
"5098","Hazrat Masrooq sey riwayat hai ke eik aurat Hazrat Abdullah bin Masood key paas aai aur boli : main kam baalon wali aurat hun. kya merey liye durust hai ke main apney baalon mein (jaali baal) jodun? unhoney farmaya : nahin. us ney kaha : kya ye tum ney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey suna hai ya Allah ki kitab mein paatey ho? unhoney farmaya : nahin balke mainey usey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey suna hai aur Allah ki kitab mein paata hun. aur unhoney hadees bayan ki."
"5099","Hazrat Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney godney waliyon, gudwane waliyon, (chehrey key baal) nochney waliyon aur khubsurti key liye daanton mein kushadgi karney waliyon par laanat farmai hai jo Allah Azza wa Jalla ki takhleeq badalti hain."
"5100","Hazrat Ibrahim sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Abdullah ney farmaya : (daanton mein) kushadgi karney waliyan. aur hadees bayan ki."
"5101","Aban bin Sama'a apni maan sey riwayat kartey hain ke unhoney farmaya : mainey Hazrat Aaisha ko farmatey suna : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney godney wali, gudwane wali, baal jodne wali, judwane wali, (bhanven) nochney wali aur nuchwane wali sey mana farmaya hai."
"5102","Hazrat Abdullah bin Murra Haaris sey, wo Hazrat Abdullah sey riwayat kartey hain ke unhoney farmaya : sood khaney wala, khilaney wala aur usey likhney wala jab wo isey jantey hon, aur khubsurti key liye godney wali aur gudwane wali, aur sadqey ko rokney wala, aur hijrat key baad dehati banney wala, Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki zaban par qiyamat key din mal'oon hain."
"5103","Hazrat Husain, Mughira aur ibne-Aun Sha'bi sey, wo Haaris sey, wo Hazrat Ali sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney sood khaney waley, khilaney waley, likhney waley aur sadqa rokney waley par laanat farmai. aur noha karney sey mana farmatey they. ibne-Aun aur Ata bin Saaeb ney isey mursal bayan kiya hai."
"5104","Hazrat ibne-Aun Sha'bi sey, wo Haaris sey riwayat kartey hain ke unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney sood khaney waley, khilaney waley, uskey gawah aur likhney waley, godney wali aur gudwane wali par laanat farmai. unhoney farmaya : magar bimari sey. unhoney farmaya : ji han. aur halala karney waley aur karwaney waley, aur sadqa rokney waley par. aur noha karney sey mana farmaya aur laanat ka lafz nahin kaha."
"5105","Hazrat Ata bin Saaeb Sha'bi sey riwayat kartey hain ke unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney sood khaney waley, khilaney waley, uskey gawah aur likhney waley, godney wali aur gudwane wali par laanat farmai. aur noha karney sey mana farmaya. aur sahab (rawi) ki laanat ka lafz nahin kaha."
"5106","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke godna karney wali eik aurat Hazrat Umar key paas laee gaee. unhoney farmaya : main tumhen Allah ki qism deta hun, kya tum mein sey kisi ney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey (is barey mein kuchh) suna hai? Hazrat Abu-Hurera ney farmaya : main khada hua aur arz ki : aey Ameerul-Mominin ! mainey suna hai. unhoney farmaya : tum ney kya suna hai? mainey kaha : mainey aap ko farmatey suna : na godna karo aur na gudwao."
"5107","Hazrat ibne-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko (bhanven) nochney waliyon, (daanton mein) kushadgi karney waliyon aur gudwane waliyon par laanat farmatey suna jo Allah Azza wa Jalla ki takhleeq badalti hain."
"5108","Hazrat Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : Allah nochney waliyon, gudwane waliyon aur (daanton mein) kushadgi karney waliyon par laanat farmaye jo Allah Azza wa Jalla ki takhleeq badalti hain."
"5109","Hazrat Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : Allah nochney waliyon, gudwane waliyon aur (daanton mein) kushadgi karney waliyon par laanat farmaye jo Allah Azza wa Jalla ki takhleeq badalti hain."
"5110","Hazrat Abu Al-Husain Himyari sey riwayat hai ke wo aur unka eik sathi Abu-Raihana sey neki seekhney key liye unkey paas rehtey they. unhoney farmaya : eik din mera sathi aaya aur mujhey bataya ke us ney Abu-Raihana ko farmatey suna : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney daanton ko nokeela karney, godney aur baal nochney sey mana farmaya hai."
"5111","Hazrat Abu-Raihana sey riwayat hai ke hamen ye baat pahunchi hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney daanton ko nokeela karney aur godney sey mana farmaya hai."
"5112","Hazrat Abu-Raihana sey riwayat hai ke hamen ye baat pahunchi hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney daanton ko nokeela karney aur godney sey mana farmaya hai."
"5113","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : be-shak tumharey behtareen surmon mein sey ismid (surma) hai. wo nazar tez karta hai aur baal (palken) ugata hai. Abu Abdur-Rehman Abdullah bin Usman bin Khusaim hadees mein narm hain."
"5114","Hazrat Simaak sey riwayat hai ke mainey Hazrat Jabir bin Samura sey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key safed baalon key barey mein puchha gaya to unhoney farmaya : jab aap apney sar mein tel lagatey to wo nazar nahin aatey they. aur jab tel na lagatey to nazar aatey they."
"5115","Hazrat Abdullah bin Zaid apney baap sey riwayat kartey hain ke Hazrat ibne-Umar apney kapdey zaafraan sey rangtey they. un sey puchha gaya to unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) (apney kapdey) rangtey they."
"5116","Hazrat Muhammad bin Ali sey riwayat hai ke mainey Hazrat Aaisha sey puchha : kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) khushbu lagatey they? unhoney farmaya : ji han, tez khushbu, mushk aur ambar."
"5117","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : mardon ki khushbu wo hai jiski mehak zahir ho aur rang chhupa ho. aur aurton ki khushbu wo hai jiska rang zahir ho aur mehak chhupi ho."
"5118","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke mardon ki khushbu wo hai jiski mehak zahir ho aur rang chhupa ho. aur aurton ki khushbu wo hai jiska rang zahir ho aur mehak chhupi ho."
"5119","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Bani-Israel ki eik aurat ney soney ki angoothi banai aur usey mushk sey bhar liya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : wo behtareen khushbu hai."
"5120","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke eik aadmi Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaya jabkey us par khaluq ka nishan tha. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us sey farmaya : jao, usey ragad kar saaf karo. phir wo aaya to farmaya : jao, usey ragad kar saaf karo. phir wo aaya to farmaya : jao, usey ragad kar saaf karo, phir na karna."
"5121","Hazrat Yaala bin Murra sey riwayat hai ke wo Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas sey guzrey jabkey wo khaluq lagaye huye they. aap ney un sey farmaya : kya tumhari biwi hai? unhoney kaha : nahin. aap ney farmaya : usey dho lo, phir usey dho lo, phir na karna."
"5122","Hazrat Yaala bin Murra sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney khaluq lagaye huye eik aadmi ko dekha aur farmaya : jao, usey dho lo, phir usey dho lo aur na karna."
"5123","Hazrat Yaala sey aisi hi riwayat manqul hai. Sufiyan ney mukhalifat ki hai. unhoney Ata bin Saaeb sey, unhoney Abdullah bin Hafs sey, unhoney Yaala sey riwayat ki hai."
"5124","Hazrat Yaala bin Murra Saqafi sey riwayat hai ke mujhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney dekha jabkey mujh par khaluq ka nishan tha. aap ney farmaya : aey Yaala ! tumhari biwi hai? mainey kaha : nahin. aap ney farmaya : usey dho lo phir na karna, phir usey dho lo phir na karna, phir usey dho lo phir na karna. unhoney farmaya : phir mainey usey dho liya, phir nahin kiya unhoney farmaya : phir mainey usey dho liya, phir nahin kiya, phir mainey usey dho liya, phir nahin kiya, phir mainey usey dho liya, phir nahin kiya."
"5125","Hazrat Yaala sey riwayat hai ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas sey guzra jabkey main khaluq lagaye huye tha. aap ney farmaya : aey Yaala ! tumhari biwi hai? mainey kaha : nahin. aap ney farmaya : jao, usey dho lo, phir usey dho lo, phir usey dho lo, phir na karna. unhoney farmaya : phir main gaya aur usey dho liya, phir usey dho liya, phir mainey usey dho liya, phir mainey usey dho liya, phir nahin kiya."
"5126","Hazrat Ash'ari (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo aurat khushbu laga kar logon key paas sey guzrey taake wo uski khushbu paen to wo zaniya hai."
"5127","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab aurat masjid ko jaey to khushbu door karney key liye ghusl karey jaisa janabat door karney key liye ghusl karti hai. ye mukhtasar surat hai."
"5128","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo aurat bakhoor (khushbu) lagaye wo hamarey sath Isha aakhira mein shareek na ho. Abu Abdur-Rehman (Imam Nasai) ney farmaya : main kisi ko nahin janta jis ney Yazeed bin Khusaifa sey Busar key wastey sey mutaba'at ki ho aur Yaqoob bin Abdullah bin Ashaj ney uski mukhalifat ki hai, unhoney usey Zainab Saqafiya sey riwayat kiya hai."
"5129","Hazrat Zainab jo Hazrat Abdullah ki biwi hain, sey riwayat hai ke unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab tum mein sey koi Isha ki namaz mein hazir ho to khushbu na lagaye."
"5130","Hazrat Zainab jo Hazrat Abdullah ki biwi hain, sey riwayat hai ke unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab tum mein sey koi Isha mein hazir ho to khushbu na lagaye. Abu Abdur-Rehman (Imam Nasai) ney farmaya : Yahya aur Jareer ki hadees Wuhaib bin Khalid ki hadees sey ziyada sahih hai. Allah Taala behtar janta hai."
"5131","Hazrat Zainab Saqafiya sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tum mein sey jo (aurat) masjid ko jaey wo khushbu key qareeb na jaey."
"5132","Hazrat Zainab Saqafiya jo Hazrat Abdullah ki biwi hain, sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney unhen hukm diya ke jab wo Isha aakhira key liye niklen to khushbu na lagayen."
"5133","Hazrat Zainab Saqafiya sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab aurat Isha aakhira key liye nikley to khushbu na lagaye."
"5134","Hazrat Zainab Saqafiya sey riwayat hai ke unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab tum mein sey koi namaz mein hazir ho to khushbu na lagaye. Abu Abdur-Rehman (Imam Nasai) ney farmaya : aur ye Zohri ki hadees sey ghair-mehfooz hai."
"5135","Hazrat Naafey sey riwayat hai ke jab Hazrat ibne-Umar khushbu sulgatey to alooah (oud) sulgatey jo khalis hoti, aur kafoor jo us mein milatey. phir farmaya : isi tarah Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) khushbu sulgatey they."
"5136","Hazrat Uqba bin Aamir sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) apney ghar walon ko zewar aur resham sey roktey they aur farmatey they : agar tum jannat key zewar aur resham ko pasand karti ho to unhen dunya mein na pehno."
"5137","Hazrat Rib'ee apni biwi sey, wo Huzefa ki behan sey riwayat kartey hain ke unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney hamen khutba diya aur farmaya : aey aurton ki jamaat ! kya tumharey paas chaandi mein sey zewar nahin? khabardaar ! jo aurat sona pehen kar zahir karegi usey uski wajeh sey azaab diya jaeyga."
"5138","Hazrat Rib'ee apni biwi sey, wo Huzefa ki behan sey riwayat kartey hain ke unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney hamen khutba diya aur farmaya : aey aurton ki jamaat ! kya tumharey paas chaandi mein sey zewar nahin? khabardaar ! tum mein sey jo aurat sona pehen kar zahir karegi usey uski wajeh sey azaab diya jaeyga."
"5139","Hazrat Asma bint-e-Yazeed sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo aurat soney ka haar pehneygi uski gardan mein usi jaisa aag ka (haar) daala jaeyga. aur jo aurat apney kaan mein soney ki bali daalegi, Allah Azza wa Jalla uskey kaan mein usi jaisi aag ki (bali) daalega aur jo aurat apney kaan mein soney ki bali daalegi, Allah uskey kaan mein usi jaisi aag ki bali daalega qiyamat key din."
"5140","Hazrat Abu Asma Rahbi sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key azaad kardah ghulam Hazrat Sauban ney unhen bataya, unhoney farmaya : Hubaira ki beti Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aai jabkey uskey haath mein fatakh tha. unhoney farmaya : merey abba ki kitab mein aisa hai, yani badi angoothiyan. phir to us ney apney baap ki kitab mein aisa paaya, yani badi angoothiyan. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) uska haath maarney lagey. wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki beti Fatima key paas gaee aur un sey uski shikayat ki jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney uskey sath kiya tha. Fatima ney apni gardan mein sey soney ki eik zanjeer utaari aur kaha : ye mujhey Abu-Hasan ney hadiya di hai. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) aaye jabkey zanjeer unkey haath mein thi. aap ney farmaya : aey Fatima ! kya tumhen dhoka hai ke log kahengey ke Rasulullah ki beti hai aur uskey haath mein aag ki zanjeer hai? phir wo bahar nikley aur bethey nahin. Fatima ney zanjeer bazaar bhej di aur usey bech diya. uski qeemat sey ghulam khareeda. aur eik baar farmaya : banda, aur eik kalima bayan kiya jiska mafhoom hai, phir usey aazad kar diya. aap ko iski khabar di gaee to aap ney farmaya : tamam tareef Allah key liye hai jis ney Fatima ko aag sey nijaat di."
"5141","Hazrat Abu Asma Hazrat Sauban sey riwayat kartey hain ke Hubaira ki beti Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aai jabkey uskey haath mein soney ka fatakh tha, yani badi angoothiyan, aisi hi (riwayat hai)."
"5142","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke main Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas betha tha. eik aurat aai aur boli : aey Allah key Rasool ! soney key do kangan? aap ney farmaya : aag key do kangan. us ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! soney ka haar? aap ney farmaya us ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! soney ki do baliyan? aap ney farmaya : aag ki do baliyan. unhoney kaha : unkey paas soney key do kangan they to unhoney dono phenk diye. us ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! aurat jab apney shohar key liye zeenat na karey to uskey nazdeek na-pasand ho jati hai. aap ney farmaya : tum mein sey kisi ko kya rokta hai ke wo chaandi ki do baliyan banaye phir unhen zaafraan ya abeer sey peela kar ley. lafz ibne-Harb ka hai."
"5143","Hazrat Urwa Hazrat Aaisha sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney unhen soney key do kangan pehney dekha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kya main tumhen is sey behtar na bataun? agar tum inhen utaar do aur chaandi key do kangan pehen lo phir unhen zaafraan sey peela kar lo to wo umda hongey. Abu Abdur-Rehman (Imam Nasai) ney farmaya Abu-Abdur-Rehman (Imam Nasai) ney farmaya : ye ghair-mehfooz hai. Allah behtar janta hai."
"5144","Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney resham pakda aur usey apney dayen haath mein rakha. aur sona pakda aur usey apney bayen haath mein rakha. phir farmaya : be-shak ye dono meri ummat key mardon par haram hain."
"5145","Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney resham pakda aur usey apney dayen haath mein rakha. aur sona pakda aur usey apney bayen haath mein rakha. phir farmaya : be-shak ye dono meri ummat key mardon par haram hain."
"5146","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney resham pakda aur usey apney dayen haath mein rakha. aur sona pakda aur usey apney bayen haath mein rakha. phir farmaya : be-shak ye dono meri ummat key mardon par haram hain."
"5147","Hazrat Abdullah bin Zurer Ghafiqi sey riwayat hai ke mainey Hazrat Ali ko farmatey suna : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney sona apney dayen haath mein aur resham apney bayen haath mein liya aur farmaya : ye meri ummat key mardon par haram hai."
"5148","Hazrat Abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : sona aur resham meri ummat ki aurton key liye halal kiya gaya hai aur uskey mardon par haram hai."
"5149","Hazrat Muawiya sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney resham aur sona pehenney sey mana farmaya hai magar tukdey tukdey (kat kar). Abdul-Wahhab ney mukhalifat ki hai. unhoney Khalid sey, unhoney Maimun sey, unhoney Abu-Qilaba sey riwayat ki hai."
"5150","Hazrat Muawiya sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney kat kar (tukdey bana kar istemal karney) key siwa sona pehenney sey mana farmaya hai. aur mayasir par sawari sey (mana farmaya hai)."
"5151","Hazrat Abu-Sheikh sey riwayat hai ke unhoney Hazrat Muawiya ko suna jabkey unkey paas Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key sahaba ki jamaat thi. unhoney farmaya : kya tum jantey ho ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney kat kar (tukdey bana kar istemal karney) key siwa sona pehenney sey mana farmaya hai? unhoney kaha : aey Allah ! ji han."
"5152","Hazrat Abu-Sheikh sey riwayat hai ke jab hum Hazrat Muawiya key sath unkey kisi hajj mein they ke unhoney Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key sahaba mein sey eik jamaat jama ki aur un sey farmaya : kya tum nahin jantey ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney kat kar (tukdey bana kar istemal karney) key siwa sona pehenney sey mana farmaya hai? unhoney kaha : aey Allah ! ji han. Yahya bin Abi Kaseer ney apney ashaab key ikhtilaf key sath mukhalifat ki hai"
"5153","Hazrat Abu-Himman sey riwayat hai ke jab Hazrat Muawiya ney hajj kiya to unhoney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key sahaba mein sey eik jamaat ko Kaaba mein jama kiya aur un sey farmaya : main tumhen Allah ki qism deta hun : kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney sona pehenney sey mana farmaya hai? unhoney kaha : ji han. unhoney farmaya : aur main gawah hun."
"5154","Hazrat Abu-Sheikh apney bhai Himman sey riwayat kartey hain ke jab Hazrat Muawiya ney hajj kiya to unhoney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key sahaba mein sey eik jamaat ko Kaaba mein jama kiya aur un sey farmaya : main tumhen Allah ki qism deta hun, kya Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney sona pehenney sey mana farmaya hai? unhoney kaha : ji han. unhoney farmaya : aur unhoney farmaya : aur main gawah hun. Awzaai ney apney ashaab key ikhtilaf key sath mukhalifat ki hai."
"5155","Himman ney farmaya : Hazrat Muawiya ney hajj kiya aur Kaaba mein ansaar mein sey eik jamaat ko bulaya aur farmaya : main tumhen Allah ki qism deta hun, kya tum ney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko sona sey mana farmatey suna hai? unhoney kaha : ji han. unhoney farmaya : aur main gawah hun."
"5156","Hazrat Abu-Ishaq sey riwayat hai ke unhoney farmaya : mujhey Himman ney bataya. unhoney farmaya : Hazrat Muawiya ney hajj kiya aur Kaaba mein ansaar mein sey eik jamaat ko bulaya aur farmaya : kya tum ney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko sona sey mana farmatey suna hai? unhoney kaha : aey Allah ! ji han. unhoney farmaya : aur main gawah hun."
"5157","Hazrat Abu-Ishaq sey riwayat hai ke unhoney farmaya : mujhey merey waalid Himman ney bataya. unhoney farmaya : Hazrat Muawiya ney hajj kiya aur Kaaba mein ansaar mein sey eik jamaat ko bulaya aur farmaya : kya tum ney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko sona sey mana farmatey suna hai? unhoney kaha : ji han. unhoney farmaya : aur main gawah hun."
"5158","Hazrat Yahya sey riwayat hai ke unhoney farmaya : mujhey Himman ney bataya. unhoney farmaya : Hazrat Muawiya ney hajj kiya aur Kaaba mein ansaar mein sey eik jamaat ko bulaya aur farmaya : main tumhen Allah ki qism deta hun, kya tum ney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko sona sey mana farmatey suna hai? unhoney kaha : aey Allah unhoney kaha : aey Allah ! ji han. unhoney farmaya : aur main gawah hun. Abu-Abdur-Rehman ney farmaya : Umaara Yahya sey ziyada yaad rakhney wala hai aur uski hadees ziyada durust key layak hai."
"5159","Hazrat Abu-Sheikh Hunaai sey riwayat hai ke mainey Hazrat Muawiya ko muhajireen aur ansaar mein sey unkey ird-gird logon sey farmatey suna : kya tum jantey ho ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney resham pehenney sey mana farmaya hai? unhoney kaha : aey Allah ! ji han. unhoney farmaya : aur sona pehenney sey magar kat kar (tukdey bana kar). (ye hadees marfooa hai) (ye hadees mauqoof hai)."
"5160","Hazrat Abu-Sheikh sey riwayat hai ke mainey Hazrat ibne-Umar ko farmatey suna : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney kat kar (tukdey bana kar istemal karney) key siwa sona pehenney sey mana farmaya hai. Abu Abdur-Rehman (Imam Nasai) ney farmaya : Nazar ki hadees ziyada sahih key mushabeh hai. Allah Taala behtar janta hai."
"5161","Hazrat Abdur-Rehman bin Tarfa apney dada Arfaja bin As'ad sey riwayat kartey hain ke jang Kilaab mein zamanae-jahiliyat mein unki naak kat gaee thi. unhoney chaandi ki naak lagaa li. us sey badbu aaney lagi to Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney unhen soney ki naak laganey ka hukm diya."
"5162","Hazrat Abdur-Rehman bin Tarfa Arfaja bin As'ad bin Kuraib sey riwayat kartey hain. aur wo unkey dada they. unhoney bataya ke unhoney apney dada ko dekha ke jang Kilaab mein zamanae-jahiliyat mein unki naak kat gaee thi. unhoney farmaya : phir unhoney chaandi ki naak lagaa li. us sey badbu aaney lagi to Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney unhen hukm diya ke usey soney ki bana len."
"5163","Hazrat Saeed bin Musaiyab sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Umar ney Suhaib sey kaha : tumhen soney ki angoothi pehney kyon dekh raha hun? unhoney kaha : us ney dekha jo tum sey behtar tha aur us ney aitraaz nahin kiya. unhoney kaha : wo kon hain? unhoney kaha : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam)"
"5164","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney soney ki angoothi pehni. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney usey pehna to logon ney soney ki angoothiyan pehen lin. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : main ye angoothi pehenta tha aur ab kabhi nahin pehnunga. phir aap ney usey phenk diya to logon ney apni angoothiyan phenk din."
"5165","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mujhey soney ki angoothi, qassi aur surkh mayasir sey mana farmaya. aur ju'a sey (mana farmaya)."
"5166","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney soney ki angoothi, qassi aur surkh mayasir sey mana farmaya hai."
"5167","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney soney key halqey, surkh gaddi, qassi key kapdon aur ju'a (jo ki sharab jo aur gehun sey banti hai) sey mana farmaya hai. aur uski sakhti ka zikr kiya. Ammaar bin Ruzaiq ney mukhalifat ki hai. unhoney Abu-Ishaq sey, unhoney Sa'sa'a sey, unhoney Hazrat Ali sey riwayat ki hai."
"5168","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mujhey soney key halqey, qassi, gaddi aur ju'a sey mana farmaya hai. Abu Abdur-Rehman (Imam Nasai) ney farmaya : is sey pehli (riwayat) ziyada sahih key mushabeh hai."
"5169","Hazrat Sa'sa'a bin Sauhan sey riwayat hai ke mainey Hazrat Ali sey kaha : hamen un chizon sey rokain jin sey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney aap ko roka tha. unhoney farmaya : unhoney mujhey dubba, hantam, soney key halqey, resham pehenney, qassi aur surkh gaddi sey mana farmaya tha."
"5170","Hazrat Malik bin Umair sey riwayat hai ke Sa'sa'a bin Sauhan Hazrat Ali key paas aaye aur farmaya : hamen un chizon sey rokain jin sey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney aap ko roka tha. unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney hamen dubba, hantam, naqeer, ju'a sey mana farmaya. aur hamen sona aur hamen soney ki angoothi, resham pehenney, qassi pehenney aur surkh mishara pehenney sey mana farmaya."
"5171","Hazrat Sa'sa'a bin Sauhan ney Hazrat Ali sey kaha : aey Ameerul-Mominin ! hamen un chizon sey rokain jin sey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney aap ko roka tha. unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney hamen dubba, hantam, ju'a, soney key halqon, resham pehenney aur surkh gaddi sey mana farmaya tha."
"5172","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke merey mehboob (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mujhey teen chizon sey mana farmaya hai. main nahin kehta ke logon ko mana farmaya. unhoney mujhey soney ki angoothi pehenney, qassi pehenney aur gehrey surkh (muasfar) kapdey sey mana farmaya aur (unhoney mujhey) sajdey ya ruku ki haalat mein qiraat sey mana farmaya. Zahhak bin Usman ney mutaba'at ki hai."
"5173","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mujhey mana farmaya. aur main nahin kehta ke tumhen mana farmaya. soney ki angoothi pehenney, qassi pehenney, gehrey surkh kapdey pehenney aur ruku mein qiraat karney sey."
"5174","Hazrat Ibrahim apney baap sey riwayat kartey hain ke unhoney Hazrat Ali ko farmatey suna : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mujhey ruku mein qiraat karney, sona aur muasfar (zaafraan-ranga) pehenney sey mana farmaya hai."
"5175","Hazrat Ibrahim bin Abdullah bin Hunain apney baap sey riwayat kartey hain ke mainey Hazrat Ali ko farmatey suna : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mujhey mana farmaya. aur main nahin kehta ke tumhen mana farmaya. soney ki angoothi, qassi, muasfar sey aur ke main ruku mein qiraat na karun."
"5176","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mujhey soney ki angoothi pehenney, muasfar, qassi pehenney aur ruku mein qiraat karney sey mana farmaya hai."
"5177","Hazrat ibne-Hunain jo ibne-Abbas key azaad kardah ghulam hain, sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Ali ney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mujhey qassi, muasfar pehenney aur soney ki angoothi pehenney sey mana farmaya hai."
"5178","Hazrat ibne-Hunain jo Hazrat Ali key azaad kardah ghulam hain, sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Ali Raziallahu anhu ney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mujhey chaar chizon sey mana farmaya hai : soney ki angoothi pehenney, qassi pehenney, ruku mein Quran padhney aur muasfar pehenney sey. aur Ayyub ney muwafiqat ki hai magar unhoney ghulam ka naam nahin liya"
"5179","Hazrat Naafey Abbas key eik azaad kardah ghulam sey riwayat kartey hain ke Hazrat Ali ney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mujhey muasfar pehenney, qassi, soney ki angoothi sey mana farmaya hai aur ke main ruku mein qiraat na karun."
"5180","Hazrat ibne-Hunain sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Ali ney un sey farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mujhey muasfar key kapdon, soney ki angoothi, qassi pehenney aur ruku mein qiraat karney sey mana farmaya hai. Lais bin Saad ney mukhalifat ki hai."
"5181","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney muasfar, qassi key kapdon aur ruku mein qiraat karney sey mana farmaya hai."
"5182","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mana farmaya. aur hadees bayan ki."
"5183","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mujhey qassi, resham, soney ki angoothi aur ruku mein qiraat karney sey mana farmaya hai. Hisham ney mukhalifat ki hai aur usey marfooan bayan nahin kiya."
"5184","Hazrat Ubaida sey, wo Hazrat Ali sey riwayat kartey hain ke unhoney farmaya : (Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney) surkh urjuwani gaddiyon, qassi pehenney aur soney ki angoothi sey mana farmaya hai."
"5185","Hazrat Ubaida sey riwayat hai ke (Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney) surkh urjuwani gaddiyon aur soney ki angoothiyon sey mana farmaya hai."
"5186","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mujhey soney ki angoothi pehenney sey mana farmaya tha."
"5187","Hafs Laisi sey riwayat hai ke main gawahi deta hun ke Imran ney hamen bataya, unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney resham pehenney, soney ki angoothi pehenney aur hantam (matkon) mein peeney sey mana farmaya hai."
"5188","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ney bayan farmaya ke Najran sey eik aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaya jabkey us ney soney ki angoothi pehni hui thi. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us sey munh pher liya aur farmaya : tum merey paas aaye ho jabkey tumharey haath mein aag ka angara hai"
"5189","Hazrat Bara bin Aazib sey riwayat hai ke eik aadmi Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas betha tha jabkey us ney soney ki angoothi pehni hui thi. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key haath mein chhadi ya tehni thi. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney us sey uski ungli par maara. us aadmi ney kaha us ney kaha : usey bech kar uski qeemat sey madad lo. aur ye hadees munkar hai."
"5190","Hazrat Abu-Sa'alba Khushani sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney uskey haath mein soney ki angoothi dekhi aur apney paas maujood chhadi sey usey kuredney lagey. phir jab Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ghafil huye to us ney usey phenk diya. aap ney farmaya : mera khayal hai ke ham ney tumhen takleef pahunchai aur tumhen (nuqsan mein daal kar) taawan dilwaya. Yunus sey mukhalifat ki hai. unhoney Zohri sey, unhoney Abu-Idrees sey mursal taur par riwayat ki hai"
"5191","Hazrat Abu-Idrees Khaulani sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey mulaqat karney walon mein sey eik aadmi ney soney ki angoothi pehni. aisi hi (riwayat hai). Abu Abdur-Rehman (Imam Nasai) ney farmaya : aur Yunus ki hadees Noman ki hadees sey ziyada sahih hai."
"5192","Hazrat Abu-Idrees Khaulani sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney eik aadmi key haath mein soney ki angoothi dekhi, aisi hi (mumaniat farmai)."
"5193","Hazrat Abu-Idrees sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney eik aadmi key haath mein soney ki angoothi dekhi to apney paas maujood chhadi sey uski ungli par maara yahan tak ke us ney usey phenk diya."
"5194","Hazrat ibne-Shahab sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey (soney ki angoothi key barey mein) aisi hi riwayat manqul hai. ye riwayat mursal hai. Abu-Abdur-Rehman (Imam Nasai) ney farmaya : aur maraseel ziyada sahih key mushabeh hain. Allah Subhanahu wa Taala behtar janta hai."
"5195","Hazrat Abdullah bin Buraida apney baap sey riwayat kartey hain ke eik aadmi Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaya jabkey us ney lohey ki angoothi pehni hui thi. aap ney farmaya : kya baat hai ke main tum par dozakhiyon ka zewar dekh raha hun? phir us ney usey phenk diya. phir wo aaya jabkey us ney peetal ki angoothi pehni hui thi. aap ney farmaya : kya baat hai ke main tum sey buton ki boo pa raha hun? phir us ney usey phenk diya. us ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! main kis chiz ki (angoothi) banaun? aap ney farmaya : chaandi ki, aur usey misqaal tak na pahunchana."
"5196","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney chaandi ki angoothi banai jis ka nageena habshi tha aur us mein naqsh tha : Muhammad Rasulullah."
"5197","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki chaandi ki angoothi thi jisey aap dayen haath mein pehentey they. us ka nageena habshi tha. aap uskey nageeney ko hatheli ki taraf rakhtey they."
"5198","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki angoothi chaandi ki thi aur uska nageena usi mein sey tha."
"5199","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki angoothi chaandi ki thi aur uska nageena usi mein sey tha."
"5200","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki angoothi chaandi ki thi aur uska nageena usi mein sey tha."
"5201","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney Room ki taraf khat likhney ka irada farmaya. logon ney kaha : wo baghair muhar key khat nahin padhtey. phir aap ney chaandi ki angoothi banai. goya main uski safedi aap key haath mein dekh raha hun. aur us mein naqsh tha : Muhammad Rasulullah."
"5202","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney eik baar Isha ki namaz mein deri farma di, yahan tak ke taqreeban aadhi raat guzar gaee. phir aap tashrif laye aur hamen namaz padhai. goya main aap key haath mein chaandi ki angoothi ki safedi dekh raha hun."
"5203","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) apni angoothi dayen haath mein pehentey they."
"5204","Hazrat Abdullah bin Jaafar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) apney dayen haath mein angoothi pehentey they."
"5205","Hazrat Iyaas bin Haaris bin Muaiqib apney dada Muaiqib sey riwayat kartey hain ke unhoney farmaya : Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki angoothi lohey ki thi jis par chaandi chadhi hui thi. unhoney farmaya : aur kabhi wo merey haath mein hoti thi. aur Muaiqib Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki angoothi key muhafiz they."
"5206","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Bahrain sey eik aadmi Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaya aur salam kiya magar aap ney jawab nahin diya. uskey haath mein soney ki angoothi thi aur resham ka jubba tha. us ney dono utaar diye, phir salam kiya to aap ney jawab diya. phir unhoney farmaya : aey aey Allah key Rasool ! main abhi aap key paas aaya tha to aap ney mujh sey munh pher liya. aap ney farmaya : tumharey haath mein aag ka angara tha. us ney kaha : tab to main bahut sey angarey laya tha. aap ney farmaya : jo tum laaye ho wo hamarey liye Harrah key patharon sey behtar nahin, lekin wo dunyawi zindagi ka saman hai. us ney kaha : phir main kis (dhaat ki) angoothi pehnun? aap ney farmaya : lohey, chaandi ya peetal ka halqa."
"5207","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) chaandi ka halqa pehen kar nikley aur farmaya : jo shakhs is par (angoothi) banwana chahey to banwa ley, lekin merey naqsh par naqsh na karwana."
"5208","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney angoothi pehni aur us par naqsh karwaya. aap ney farmaya : ham ney angoothi pehni hai aur us mein naqsh karwaya hai. lihaza koi shakhs merey naqsh par naqsh na karwaye. phir Hazrat Anas ney farmaya : goya main uski chamak aap key haath mein dekh raha hun."
"5209","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : mushrikon ki aag sey roshni na lo aur apni angoothiyon par arbi (alfaz) naqsh na karwao."
"5210","Hazrat Abu-Barda sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Ali ney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mujh sey farmaya : aey Ali ! Allah sey hidayat aur isteqamat mango. aur mujhey mana farmaya ke main angoothi is mein aur is mein pehnun. aur ishara farmaya, yani shahadat aur darmiyani (ungli)."
"5211","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mujhey is mein aur is mein, yani shahadat aur darmiyani (ungli) mein angoothi pehenney sey mana farmaya hai."
"5212","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mujh sey farmaya : kaho : aey Allah ! mujhey hidayat dey aur seedha rakh. aur mujhey mana farmaya ke main angoothi is mein aur is mein pehnun. aur Bishr ney shahadat aur darmiyani (ungli) sey ishara kiya. unhoney farmaya : aur Aasim ney kaha : un mein sey eik."
"5213","Hazrat Zohri Hazrat Anas sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) jab baitul-khala mein dakhil hotey to apni angoothi utaar detey they."
"5214","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney soney ki angoothi pehni aur uska nageena hatheli ki taraf rakha. phir logon ney soney ki angoothiyan pehen lin. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney apni angoothi phenk di aur farmaya : main usey kabhi nahin pehnunga. aur logon ney apni angoothiyan phenk din."
"5215","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney soney ki angoothi pehni aur uska nageena us taraf rakha jo hatheli ki taraf hai. phir logon ney angoothiyan pehen lin. phir Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney usey phenk diya aur farmaya : main usey kabhi nahin pehnunga."
"5216","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) soney ki angoothi pehentey they, phir usey utaar diya aur chaandi ki angoothi pehni aur us mein naqsh karwaya : Muhammad Rasulullah. aur farmaya : kisi shakhs ko zeb nahin deta ke wo meri is angoothi key naqsh par naqsh karwaye. phir uskey nageeney ko hatheli key andar ki taraf kar liya."
"5217","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney teen din soney ki angoothi pehni. phir jab sahaba ney usey dekha to soney ki angoothiyan phel gaeen. phir aap ney usey phenk diya. hamen malum nahin ke uska kya hua. phir aap ney chaandi ki angoothi ka hukm diya aur hukm diya ke us mein naqsh kiya jaey : Muhammad Rasulullah. aur wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key haath mein rahi yahan tak ke aur wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key haath mein rahi yahan tak ke aap faut huye. aur Hazrat Abu-Bakar key haath mein rahi yahan tak ke wo faut huye. aur Hazrat Umar key haath mein rahi yahan tak ke wo faut huye. aur Hazrat Usman key haath mein unkey kaam key chhe saal rahi. phir jab un par khatoot ziyada huye to unhoney usey ansaar mein sey eik aadmi ko dey diya jo us sey moher lagaya karta tha. wo Ansari Usman key eik kunwen ki taraf nikla to wo gir gaee. usey talash kiya gaya magar na mili. phir unhoney us jaisi angoothi ka hukm diya aur us mein Muhammad Rasulullah naqsh kiya gaya."
"5218","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney soney ki angoothi pehni jabkey uska nageena hatheli key andar ki taraf tha. phir logon ney soney ki angoothiyan pehen lin. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney usey phenk diya. phir logon ney apni angoothiyan phenk din. aur chaandi ki angoothi banai. aap us sey muhar lagatey they aur usey pehentey nahin they."
"5219","Hazrat Abu-Bakar bin Abi Sheikh sey riwayat hai ke main Salim key sath betha tha. hamarey paas sey Ummul-Baneen ka eik qafila guzra jinkey paas ghungrun they. Salim ney Naafey ko apney baap sey riwayat kar key bataya ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : farishtey us qafiley key sath nahin hotey tum in logon key paas kitney ghungrun dekhtey ho."
"5220","Hazrat Salim apney baap sey, wo Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey riwayat kartey hain ke aap ney farmaya : farishtey us jamaat key sath nahin hotey jis mein ghungrun hon."
"5222","Ummul-Mominin Hazrat Ummey Salma (Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki biwi) sey riwayat hai ke unhoney farmaya : mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : farishtey us ghar mein dakhil nahin hotey jis mein ghungrun ya ghanti ho. aur farishtey us jamaat key sath nahin hotey jis mein ghanti ho."
"5223","Hazrat Abu Al-Ahwas apney baap sey riwayat kartey hain ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas betha tha. aap ney mujhey puraney kapdon mein dekha. aap ney farmaya : kya tumharey paas maal hai? mainey kaha : ji han, aey Allah key Rasool ! har qisam ka maal. aap ney farmaya : phir jab Allah tumhen maal dey to uska asar tum par nazar aana chahiye."
"5224","Hazrat Abu Al-Ahwas apney baap sey riwayat kartey hain ke wo Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas mamuli kapdey pehen kar aaye. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney un sey farmaya : kya tumharey paas maal hai? unhoney kaha : ji han, har qisam ka maal. aap ney farmaya : kis qisam ka maal? unhoney kaha : Allah ney mujhey oont, bakriyan, ghodey aur ghulam diye hain. aap ney farmaya : phir jab Allah tumhen maal ho to Allah ki nemat aur izzat ka asar tum par nazar aana chahiye."
"5225","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mujh sey farmaya : paanch cheezen fitrat mein sey hain : munchhen kaatna, baghal key baal ukhedna, nakhun tarashna aur sharmgah key baal saaf karna aur khatna."
"5226","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke munchhen khatm karo aur dadhi poori rakho."
"5227","Hazrat Abdullah bin Jaafar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney aal-e-Jaafar ko teen din mohlat di ke unkey paas (taziyat key liye) na aayen. phir aap unkey paas aaye aur farmaya : aaj key baad merey bhai par na rona. phir farmaya : merey bhai key beton ko merey paas bulao. phir hum laaye gaey goya hum chuzey hon. aap ney farmaya mujhey naai ko merey paas bulao. phir naai bulaya gaya aur unhoney hamarey saron key mundaney ka hukm diya. mukhtasar."
"5228","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney qaza sey mana farmaya hai."
"5229","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke unhoney farmaya : mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko qaza sey mana farmatey suna hai."
"5230","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney qaza sey mana farmaya hai."
"5231","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke aap ney qaza sey mana farmaya hai."
"5232","Hazrat Bara (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) darmiyana qad key khush-andam khuley kandhon waley, ghani dadhi waley they. aap key chehrey par surkhi thi. aap ki zulfen kaanon ki lau tak aati thin. mainey aap ko surkh hulla mein dekha. mainey aap sey badh kar haseen nahin dekha."
"5233","Hazrat Bara (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke mainey zulfon walon mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey badh kar surkh hulla mein kisi ko haseen nahin dekha. aur aap key baal kandhon tak aatey they."
"5234","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key baal aadhey kaanon tak aatey they."
"5235","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key baal kandhon tak aatey they."
"5236","Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke unhoney farmaya : Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) hamarey paas tashrif laye aur eik bikherey baalon waley aadmi ko dekha. aap ney farmaya : kya ye apney baalon ko sanwarney key liye kuchh nahin pata?"
"5237","Hazrat Abu-Qatada (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke unki badi zulfen thin. unhoney Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey puchha to aap ney unhen hukm diya ke uski achchhi dekh-bhaal karen aur roz kanghi karen."
"5238","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) apney baal latkaye rakhtey they. aur mushrik apney baalon ki maang nikaltey they. aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) jin baton mein koi hukm na hota un mein ehl-e-kitab ki muwafiqat pasand farmatey they. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney baad mein maang nikali"
"5239","Hazrat Abdullah bin Buraida sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key sahaba mein sey Ubaid naami eik aadmi ney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ziyada aaraam-talbi sey mana farmatey they. ibne-Buraida sey aaraam-talbi key barey mein puchha gaya. unhoney farmaya : us mein sey kanghi karna hai."
"5240","Hazrat Masrooq Hazrat Aaisha sey riwayat kartey hain ke unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) jahan tak ho sakta taharat, joota pehenney aur kanghi karney mein dayen sey shuru karna pasand farmatey they."
"5241","Hazrat Abu-Salma aur Sulaiman bin Yasar sey riwayat hai ke unhoney Hazrat Abu-Hurera ko Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey khabar detey suna ke aap ney farmaya : be-shak Yahud-o-Nasaara (baal) nahin rangtey, lihaza tum unki mukhalifat karo."
"5242","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas Abu-Quhafa ko laya gaya jabkey unka sar aur dadhi saghamah (safed ghaas) ki tarah safed they. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : isey kisi chiz sey badal do."
"5243","Hazrat Ubaid sey riwayat hai ke mainey Hazrat ibne-Umar ko apni dadhi peeli kartey dekha. mainey un sey kaha : is barey mein (kya hukm hai)? unhoney farmaya : mainey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko apni dadhi peeli kartey dekha hai."
"5244","Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar Raziallahu anhuma kehtey hain ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) chamdey key jootey pehentey aur apni dadhi wars aur zaafraan sey peeli kartey they. aur ibne-Umar bhi aisa hi kartey they."
"5245","Hazrat Humaid bin Abdur-Rehman sey riwayat hai ke mainey Hazrat Muawiya ko Madina mein mimbar par suna jabkey unhoney apni aasteen sey baalon ka eik guchha nikala. unhoney farmaya : aey ehl-e-Madina ! tumharey ulema kahan hain? mainey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko aisi chiz sey mana farmatey suna hai. aur farmaya : Bani-Israel isi liye halak huin jab unki aurton ney aisa apnaya."
"5246","Hazrat Saeed bin Musaiyab sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Muawiya Madina tashrif laye aur hamen khutba diya. unhoney baalon ka eik guchha pakda aur farmaya : main kisi ko aisa kartey nahin dekhta tha siwa Yahudiyon key. aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko iski khabar hui to aap ney usey zoar (dhoka) qarar diya."
"5247","Hazrat Muawiya sey riwayat hai ke unhoney farmaya : aey logon ! Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney tumhen zoar sey mana farmaya hai. unhoney farmaya : aur kaaley kapdey ka eik tukda laya aur unkey saamney phenk diya aur farmaya : ye hai jisey aurat apney sar mein lagati hai, phir us par dupatta leti hai"
"5248","Hazrat Muawiya sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney zoar sey mana farmaya hai. aur zoar ye hai ke aurat apney sar par (jaali baal) lapet-ti hai."
"5249","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney baal jodne wali par laanat farmai hai."
"5250","Hazrat Asma sey riwayat hai ke eik aurat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aai aur boli : aey Allah key Rasool ! meri eik beti dulhan hai aur wo bimar hui to uskey baal jhad gaey. kya mujh par gunah hai agar main us mein (jaali baal) jod dun? aap ney farmaya : Allah baal jodne wali aur judwane wali par laanat farmaye."
"5251","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney baal jodne wali, judwane wali, godney wali aur gudwane wali par laanat farmai hai."
"5252","Hazrat Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Allah nochney waliyon aur (daanton mein) kushadgi karney waliyon par laanat farmaye. kya main un par laanat na karun jin par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney laanat farmai hai?"
"5253","Hazrat Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney godney waliyon, (daanton mein) kushadgi karney waliyon aur nochney waliyon par laanat farmai hai jo Allah Azza wa Jalla ki takhleeq badalti hain."
"5254","Hazrat Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Allah nochney waliyon, (daanton mein) kushadgi karney waliyon aur gudwane waliyon par laanat farmaye jo Allah ki takhleeq badalti hain. phir eik aurat aai aur boli : kya tum wahi ho jo kehtey ho : aisa aisa? unhoney farmaya : mujhey kya hai ke main wo na kahun jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya?"
"5255","Hazrat Ibrahim sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Abdullah farmatey they : Allah gudwane waliyon, nochney waliyon aur (daanton mein) kushadgi karney waliyon par laanat farmaye. kya main un par laanat na karun jin par Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney laanat farmai hai?"
"5256","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mard ko zaafraan laganey sey mana farmaya hai."
"5257","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mana farmaya hai ke mard apni jild ko zaafraan lagaye."
"5258","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas jab khushbu lai jati to aap usey radd nahin farmatey they."
"5259","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey, wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey riwayat kartey hain ke aap ney farmaya : jisey khushbu pesh ki jaey wo usey radd na karey. kyonkey wo halki aur umda mehak wali hoti hai."
"5260","Hazrat Zainab jo Hazrat Abdullah ki biwi hain, sey riwayat hai ke unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab tum mein sey koi Isha mein hazir ho to khushbu na lagaye."
"5261","Hazrat Zainab Saqafiya jo Hazrat Abdullah ki biwi hain, ney khabar di ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney un sey farmaya : jab tum Isha key liye niklo to khushbu na lagana."
"5262","Hazrat Zainab Saqafiya sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tum mein sey jo (aurat) masjid ko jaey wo khushbu key qareeb na jaey."
"5263","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo aurat bakhoor (khushbu) lagaye wo hamarey sath Isha aakhira mein shareek na ho."
"5264","Hazrat Abu-Saeed sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney eik aurat ka zikr kiya jis ney apni angoothi mushk sey bhari thi aur farmaya : aur wo behtareen khushbu hai."
"5265","Hazrat Abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : be-shak Allah Azza wa Jalla ney meri ummat ki aurton key liye resham aur sona halal kiya hai aur uskey mardon par haram hai."
"5266","Hazrat ibne-Abbas sey riwayat hai ke mujhey surkh kapdey, soney ki angoothi aur ruku mein qiraat karney sey mana farmaya gaya hai."
"5267","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mujhey soney ki angoothi, ruku mein Quran padhney, qassi aur muasfar sey mana farmaya hai."
"5268","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mujhey soney ki angoothi, qassi key libas, muasfar aur ruku mein Quran padhney sey mana farmaya hai."
"5269","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mujhey ruku mein qiraat karney sey mana farmaya hai."
"5270","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mujhey muasfar key kapdon, soney ki angoothi, qassi pehenney aur ruku mein qiraat karney sey mana farmaya hai."
"5271","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mujhey chaar chizon sey mana farmaya hai : muasfar kapda pehenney, soney ki angoothi pehenney, qassiya pehenney aur ruku mein Quran padhney sey."
"5272","Hazrat ibne-Hunain sey, wo Hazrat Ali sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney muasfar key kapdon, resham, ruku mein qiraat karney aur soney ki angoothi sey mana farmaya hai."
"5273","Hazrat Qatada sey riwayat hai ke mainey Nazar bin Anas sey, unhoney Basheer bin Naheek sey, unhoney Hazrat Abu-Hurera sey, wo Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey riwayat kartey hain ke aap ney soney ki angoothi sey mana farmaya hai."
"5274","Hazrat Qatada Hazrat Abdul-Malik bin Ubaid sey, wo Basheer bin Naheek sey, wo Hazrat Abu-Hurera sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney soney ki angoothi pehenney sey mana farmaya hai."
"5275","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney soney ki angoothi pehni. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney usey pehna to logon ney soney ki angoothiyan pehen lin. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : main ye angoothi pehenta tha aur ab kabhi nahin pehnunga. phir aap ney usey phenk diya to logon ney apni angoothiyan phenk din."
"5276","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki angoothi ka naqsh tha : Muhammad Rasulullah."
"5277","Hazrat Zohri Hazrat Anas sey riwayat kartey hain ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney chaandi ki angoothi banai jis ka nageena habshi tha aur uska naqsh tha : Muhammad Rasulullah."
"5278","Hazrat Qatada Hazrat Anas sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney Room ki taraf khat likhney ka irada farmaya. logon ney kaha : wo baghair muhar key khat nahin padhtey. phir aap ney chaandi ki angoothi banai. goya main uski safedi aap key haath mein dekh raha hun. aur us mein naqsh tha : Muhammad Rasulullah."
"5279","Hazrat Zohri Hazrat Anas sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney chaandi ki angoothi banai jis ka nageena habshi tha."
"5280","Hazrat Humaid Hazrat Anas sey riwayat kartey hain ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki angoothi chaandi ki thi aur uska nageena usi mein sey tha."
"5281","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ham ney angoothi banwai hai aur us par naqsh karwaya hai. lihaza koi shakhs us par naqsh na karwaye."
"5282","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney angoothi banai aur farmaya : ham ney angoothi banai hai aur us par naqsh karwaya hai. lihaza koi shakhs us par naqsh na karwaye. aur goya main uski chamak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki chhanguli mein dekh raha hun."
"5283","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke aap apney dayen haath mein angoothi pehentey they."
"5284","Hazrat Qatada Hazrat Anas sey riwayat kartey hain ke goya main Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki angoothi ki safedi aap ki bayen ungli mein dekh raha hun."
"5285","Hazrat Sabit sey riwayat hai ke unhoney Hazrat Anas sey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki angoothi key barey mein puchha. unhoney farmaya : goya main uski chaandi ki angoothi ki chamak dekh raha hun. aur unhoney apni bayen chhanguli uthai."
"5286","Hazrat Abu-Barda sey riwayat hai ke mainey Hazrat Ali ko farmatey suna : Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mujhey shahadat aur darmiyani (ungli) mein angoothi pehenney sey mana farmaya hai."
"5287","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mujhey mana farmaya ke main apni is ungli aur darmiyani aur us sey agli (ungli) mein (angoothi) pehnun."
"5288","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) soney ki angoothi pehentey they, phir usey utaar diya aur chaandi ki angoothi pehni aur us mein naqsh karwaya : Muhammad Rasulullah. phir farmaya : kisi shakhs ko zeb nahin deta ke wo meri is angoothi key naqsh par naqsh karwaye. aur uskey nageeney ko hatheli key andar ki taraf kar liya."
"5289","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney angoothi pehni aur farmaya : is ney mujhey aaj tum sey ghafil kar diya. kabhi isko dekhta hun aur kabhi tumhen. phir usey phenk diya."
"5290","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney soney ki angoothi banai aur usey pehentey they. uska nageena hatheli key andar ki taraf kartey they. phir logon ney (angoothiyan) banain. phir aap mimbar par bethey aur usey utaar diya aur farmaya : main ye angoothi pehenta tha aur uska nageena andar ki taraf karta tha. phir usey phenk diya. phir farmaya : Allah ki qism ! main usey kabhi nahin pehnunga. phir logon ney apni angoothiyan phenk din."
"5291","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke unhoney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key haath mein eik din chaandi ki angoothi dekhi. phir logon ney (waisi) banain aur pehnin. phir Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney (apni) phenk di aur logon ney (apni) phenk din."
"5292","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney soney ki angoothi pehni jabkey uska nageena hatheli key andar ki taraf tha. phir logon ney soney ki angoothiyan pehen lin. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney usey phenk diya. phir logon ney apni angoothiyan phenk din. aur chaandi ki angoothi banai. aap us sey muhar lagatey they aur usey pehentey nahin they."
"5293","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney soney ki angoothi pehni aur uska nageena us taraf rakha jo hatheli key andar ki taraf hai. phir logon ney angoothiyan pehen lin. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney usey phenk diya aur farmaya : main usey kabhi nahin pehnunga. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney chaandi ki angoothi banai phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney chaandi ki angoothi banai aur usey apney haath mein pehna. phir wo Hazrat Abu-Bakar key haath mein rahi, phir Hazrat Umar key haath mein rahi, phir Hazrat Usman key haath mein rahi yahan tak ke Beer-e-Arees mein halak (gum) ho gaee."
"5294","Hazrat Abu Al-Ahwas apney baap sey riwayat kartey hain ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas hazir huwa. aap ney mujhey buri haalat mein dekha. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kya tumharey paas kuchh hai? unhoney kaha : ji han, Allah ney mujhey har qisam ka maal diya hai. aap ney farmaya : jab tumharey paas maal ho to wo tum par nazar aana chahiye"
"5295","Hazrat Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke unhoney masjid key darwazey par seeraa (reshmi) hulla bikta dekha. mainey kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! kash aap isey Juma key din aur wafad key aaney par pehenney key liye khareed len? Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : isey wahi pehenta hai jiska aakhirat mein koi hissa nahin phir uskey baad Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas unhi mein sey hulla laye gaey to unhoney mujhey un mein sey eik hulla pehnaya. mainey kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! aap ney mujhey ye pehnaya jabkey aap ney is barey mein jo kaha tha so kaha tha. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : mainey tumhen ye pehenney key liye nahin pehnaya, mainey tumhen ye isliye pehnaya taake tum usey pehnao ya bech do. Hazrat Umar ney usey apney maa-sharik mushrik bhai ko pehna diya."
"5296","Hazrat Zohri Hazrat Anas sey riwayat kartey hain ke mainey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki beti Zainab par seeraa resham ki qamees dekhi."
"5297","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ney mujhey bataya ke unhoney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki beti Ummey Kulsoom par seeraa ka buraa (chadar) dekha. aur seeraa wo hai jis mein resham ki dhariyan hon."
"5298","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko seeraa ka hulla tohfey mein diya gaya. aap ney usey merey paas bhej diya. mainey usey pehen liya. phir mainey aap key chehrey mein ghussa pehchana. aap ney farmaya : mainey tumhen usey pehenney key liye nahin diya tha. phir aap ney mujhey hukm diya to mainey usey apni aurton mein taqseem kar diya."
"5299","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain ke Hazrat Umar nikley aur bazaar mein istabraq ka hulla bikta dekha. wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaye aur arz kiya : aey Allah key Rasool ! isey khareed len aur Juma key din aur jab aap key paas wafad aaye to pehna karen. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas unhi mein sey teen hulla laye gaey. unhoney Umar ko eik hulla pehnaya, Ali ko eik hulla pehnaya aur Usama ko eik hulla pehnaya. wo aaye aur boley : aey Allah key Rasool ! aap ney is barey mein jo kaha tha so kaha tha, phir aap ney meri taraf (hulla) bheja. aap ney farmaya : usey bech dey aur us sey apni hajat puri kar, ya usey phaad kar apni aurton key darmiyan dupattey bana dey."
"5300","Hazrat Yahya bin Abi Ishaq sey riwayat hai ke Salim ney farmaya : istabraq kya hai? mainey kaha : jo mota resham ho aur khurdara ho. unhoney farmaya : mainey Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar ko farmatey suna : Hazrat Umar ney eik aadmi key paas sundus ka hulla dekha. usey ley kar Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaye aur farmaya : isey khareed len. aur hadees bayan ki."
"5301","Hazrat Abdullah bin Ukaim sey riwayat hai ke Huzefa ney pani manga. dehqan chaandi key bartan mein pani laya. unhoney usey phenk diya. phir un sey apney kiye par maazirat ki aur farmaya : mainey usey mana kiya tha. mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : soney-chaandi key bartan mein na piyo, deebaaj aur resham na pehno. kyonkey ye unkey liye dunya mein hain aur hamarey liye aakhirat mein."
"5302","Hazrat Waqid bin Amr bin Saad bin Muaz sey riwayat hai ke main Hazrat Anas bin Malik key paas hazir huwa jab wo Madina tashrif laye. mainey unhen salam kiya. unhoney farmaya : tum kin mein sey ho? mainey kaha : main Waqid bin Amr bin Saad bin Muaz hun. unhoney farmaya : Saad logon mein sab sey badey aur daraz-qad they. phir roye aur bahut roye. phir farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney Doma key hukumran Ukaidir ki taraf eik lashkar bheja. us ney unki taraf deebaaj ka jubba bheja jis mein sona buna hua tha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney usey pehna, phir mimbar par khadey huye aur beth gaey, baat na ki aur neechey utrey. log usey apney haathon sey chhuney lagey. aap ney farmaya : kya tum is par taajjub kartey ho? jannat mein Saad key rumal tumharey dekhney sey behtar hain."
"5303","Hazrat Jabir sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney deebaaj ka qaba pehna jo aap ko tohfey mein diya gaya tha. phir jald hi usey utaar diya aur usey Hazrat Umar key paas bhej diya. un sey kaha gaya : aap ney kitni jald utaar diya, aey Allah key Rasool? aap ney farmaya : mujhey Jibraeel Alaihissalam ney mana farmaya hai. phir Hazrat Umar rotye huye aaye aur farmaya : aey Allah key Rasool ! aap ney napasand farmaya aap ney apney liye napasand ki hui chiz mujhey dey di. aap ney farmaya : mainey tumhen ye pehenney key liye nahin diya, mainey tumhen ye bechney key liye diya hai. Hazrat Umar ney usey do hazaar dirham mein bech diya."
"5304","Hazrat Sabit sey riwayat hai ke mainey Hazrat Abdullah bin Zuber ko mimbar par khutba detey suna jabkey wo farmatey they : Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo resham dunya mein pehnega, wo aakhirat mein nahin pehnega."
"5305","Hazrat Khalifa sey riwayat hai ke mainey Hazrat Abdullah bin Zuber ko farmatey suna : tum apni aurton ko resham na pehnao. kyonkey mainey Hazrat Umar bin Khattab ko farmatey suna : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo usey dunya mein pehnega wo aakhirat mein nahin pehnega."
"5306","Hazrat Imran bin Hittan sey riwayat hai ke unhoney Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas sey resham pehenney key barey mein puchha. unhoney farmaya : Aaisha sey puchho. phir Aaisha sey puchha. unhoney farmaya : Abdullah bin Umar sey puchho. phir mainey ibne-Umar sey puchha. unhoney farmaya : mujhey Abu-Hafs ney bataya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo jo dunya mein resham pehneyga, aakhirat mein uska koi hissa nahin."
"5307","Hazrat Bakar bin Abdullah aur Bishr bin Muhtafiz ibne-Umar sey, wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey riwayat kartey hain ke aap ney farmaya : resham wahi pehenta hai jiska (aakhirat mein) koi hissa nahin."
"5308","Hazrat Ali Bariqi sey riwayat hai ke eik aurat merey paas fatwa puchhney aai. mainey us sey kaha : ye ibne-Umar hain. wo unkey peechhey gaee aur un sey puchhney lagi. aur main bhi unkey peechhey gaya taake sunun wo kya kehtey hain. us ney kaha : mujhey resham key barey mein fatwa dijiye? unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mana farmaya hai."
"5309","Hazrat Bara bin Aazib (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney hamen saat baton ka hukm diya aur saat baton sey mana farmaya. hamen soney ki angoothiyon, chaandi key bartanon, mayasir, qassiya, istabraq, deebaaj aur resham sey mana farmaya."
"5310","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney Hazrat Abdur-Rehman bin Auf aur Zuber bin Awwam ko khujli ki wajeh sey resham ki qameesen (pehenney) ki rukhsat ata farmai."
"5311","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney Hazrat Abdur-Rehman aur Zuber ko khujli ki wajeh sey resham ki qameesen (pehenney) ki rukhsat ata farmai."
"5312","Hazrat Abu-Usman Nahdi sey riwayat hai ke hum Utba bin Farqad key sath they. Hazrat Umar ka khat aaya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : resham wahi pehenta hai jiska aakhirat mein is mein sey kuchh hissa nahin magar is tarah. aur Abu-Usman ney anguthey sey agli do ungliyon sey ishara kiya. phir mainey unhen tayalisey key button dekhey yahan tak ke tayalisey dekhey"
"5313","Hazrat Suwed bin Ghafla sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Umar ney deebaaj mein sirf chaar ungliyon ki gunjaaish rakhi hai."
"5314","Hazrat Bara (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke mainey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko surkh hulla pehney dekha jabkey aap kanghi kiye huye they. mainey aap sey pehley aur aap key baad kisi ko aap sey badh kar haseen nahin dekha."
"5315","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko sab sey pasandida libas hibra (Yemeni chadar) tha."
"5316","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke unhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney do zaafraani kapdon mein dekha aur farmaya : ye kafiron key kapdey hain. inhen na pehno."
"5317","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke wo Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaye jabkey un par do zaafraani kapdey they. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ghussa huye aur farmaya : jao, inhen utaar phenko. unhoney kaha : kahan, aey Allah key Rasool? aap ney farmaya : aag mein."
"5318","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mujhey soney ki angoothi, qassi aur muasfar pehenney aur ruku mein Quran padhney sey mana farmaya hai."
"5319","Hazrat Abu-Rimsa sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) hamarey paas tashrif laye jabkey aap par do sabz kapdey they."
"5320","Hazrat Khabbab bin Aratt (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke ham ney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey shikayat ki jabkey aap Kaaba key saaye mein apni chadar ka takiya lagaye letey huye they. ham ney kaha : kya aap hamarey liye madad nahin mangengey? kya aap Allah sey hamarey liye dua nahin karengey"
"5321","Hazrat Sahal bin Saad (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke eik aurat burda ley kar aai. Sahal ney farmaya : kya tum jantey ho burda kya hai? logon ney kaha : ji han, ye wo chadar hai jiskey kinarey baney huye hon. us ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! mainey ye apney haathon sey buni hai taake aap ko pehnaun. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney usey ley liya jabkey aap uskey mohtaj they. phir aap hamarey paas tashrif laye jabkey wo aap ka izar tha"
"5322","Hazrat Samura (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke apney kapdon mein sey safed kapdey pehno kyonkey wo ziyada paak-saaf aur umda hain. aur unhi mein apney murdon ko kafan do. Yahya ney farmaya : mainey usey nahin likha. mainey kaha : kyon? unhoney farmaya : main Maimun bin Abi Shabib ki hadees sey mustaghni ho gaya"
"5323","Hazrat Samura (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : safed kapdey pehna karo. tumharey zinda unhen pehnen aur apney murdon ko unhi mein kafan do. kyonkey wo tumharey behtareen kapdon mein sey hain."
"5324","Hazrat Miswar bin Makhrama sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney qabayen taqseem farmain aur Makhrama ko kuchh na diya. Makhrama ney kaha : aey merey betey ! hamen Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas ley chalo. phir main unkey sath gaya. unhoney farmaya : andar jao aur unhen merey liye bulao. unhoney farmaya : phir mainey unhen bulaya. phir wo unkey paas tashrif laye jabkey aap ney un mein sey eik qaba pehna hua tha. aap ney farmaya : mainey chhupa kar ke mainey ye tumharey liye chhupa kar rakha hai. unhoney usey dekha phir Makhrama ney usey pehna."
"5325","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke unhoney Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko Arafat mein farmatey suna : jisey izar na miley wo shalwar pehen ley. aur jisey jootey na milen wo moozey pehen ley."
"5326","Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab eik aadmi apna izar takabbur sey ghaseet-ta hai to zamin usey dhansa deti hai. phir wo qiyamat tak zamin mein dhansa chala jaeyga."
"5327","Hazrat Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs apna kapda ghaseet-ta hai, ya farmaya : be-shak jo shakhs apna kapda takabbur sey ghaseet-ta hai, Allah qiyamat key din uski taraf nazar nahin farmayega."
"5328","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs apna kapda takabbur sey ghaseet-ta hai to Allah Azza wa Jalla qiyamat key din uski taraf nazar nahin farmayega."
"5329","Hazrat Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : izar aadhi pindliyon aur pathon tak hai. phir agar na maney to neechey, phir agar na maney to pindli key peechhey sey. aur takhnon ka izar mein koi haq nahin."
"5330","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : takhnon sey nichey ka tehband aag mein (ley janey wala) hai."
"5331","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke takhnon sey nichey ka tehband aag mein (ley janey wala) hai."
"5332","Hazrat Saeed bin Juber ibne-Abbas sey, wo Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey riwayat kartey hain ke aap ney farmaya : be-shak Allah Azza wa Jalla izar latkaney waley ki taraf nazar nahin farmayega."
"5333","Hazrat Abu-Zar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : teen shakhs aisey hain ke Allah Azza wa Jalla qiyamat key din un sey kalam nahin farmayega aur na unhen paak karega. aur unkey liye dard-naak azaab hai : ehsaan jatlaney wala, izar latkaney wala aur jhooti qism sey apna saman bechney wala."
"5334","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : izar, qamees aur amamey mein isbaal (latkana) hota hai. jo in mein sey koi chiz takabbur sey ghaseet-ta hai, Allah qiyamat key din uski taraf nazar nahin farmayega."
"5335","Hazrat Salim apney baap sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs apna kapda takabbur sey ghaseet-ta hai, Allah qiyamat key din uski taraf nazar nahin farmayega. Hazrat Abu-Bakar ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! merey izar ka eik hissa dheela ho jata hai magar ye ke main uska khayal rakhta hun. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tum un mein sey nahin ho jo aisa takabbur sey kartey hain."
"5336","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs apna kapda takabbur sey ghaseet-ta hai, Allah uski taraf nazar nahin farmayega. Ummul-Mominin Hazrat Ummey Salma ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! aurten apney daamanon ka kya karen? aap ney farmaya : eik balisht latka len. unhoney kaha : tab to unkey qadam khul jaengey? aap ney farmaya aap ney farmaya : eik haath latka len, is sey ziyada na badhayen."
"5337","Hazrat Ummey Salma sey riwayat hai ke unhoney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey aurton key daamanon ka zikr kiya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : eik balisht latka len. Ummul-Mominin Hazrat Ummey Salma ney kaha : tab to (qadam) khul jaeyga? aap ney farmaya : eik haath latka ley, is sey ziyada na badhaye."
"5338","Hazrat Ummey Salma sey riwayat hai ke jab Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney izar key barey mein jo farmaya tha, farmaya to Ummul-Mominin Hazrat Ummey Salma ney kaha : aurton ka kya hoga? aap ney farmaya : eik balisht latka len. unhoney kaha : tab to unkey qadam zahir ho jaengey? aap ney farmaya : phir eik haath, is sey ziyada na badhayen."
"5339","Hazrat Ummey Salma sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey puchha gaya : aurat apney daaman mein sey kitna ghaseet sakti hai? aap ney farmaya : eik balisht. unhoney kaha : tab to (qadam) khul jaeyga? aap ney farmaya : eik haath, is sey ziyada nahin."
"5340","Hazrat Abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney ishtimaal-e-samma aur eik kapdey mein guth-muth honey sey mana farmaya hai jabkey uski sharmgaah par us mein sey kuchh na ho."
"5341","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney ishtimaal-e-samma aur mard key eik kapdey mein guth-muth honey sey mana farmaya hai jabkey uski sharmgaah par us mein sey kuchh na ho."
"5342","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney ishtimaal-e-samma aur eik kapdey mein guth-muth honey sey mana farmaya hai."
"5343","Hazrat Amr bin Hurees key baap sey riwayat hai ke mainey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko hurqani (kaali) amama bandhey dekha."
"5344","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) Fath-Makka key din dakhil huye jabkey aap par baghair ehraam key kaali amama thi."
"5345","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) Fath key din dakhil huye jabkey aap par kaali amama thi."
"5346","Hazrat Jaafar bin Amr bin Umayya apney baap sey riwayat kartey hain ke goya main is waqt Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko mimbar par dekh raha hun jabkey aap par kaali amama hai jiskey kinarey ko aap ney dono kandhon key darmiyan latka rakha hai."
"5347","Hazrat ibne-Abbas Hazrat Abu-Talha sey, wo Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey riwayat kartey hain ke aap ney farmaya : farishtey us ghar mein dakhil nahin hotey jis mein kutta ya tasweer ho."
"5348","Hazrat ibne-Abbas Hazrat Abu-Talha sey riwayat kartey hain ke mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : farishtey us ghar mein dakhil nahin hotey jis mein kutta ya mujassamon ki tasweer ho."
"5349","Hazrat Ubedullah bin Abdullah sey riwayat hai ke wo Hazrat Abu-Talha Ansari key paas unki ayadat key liye gaey. unhoney unkey paas Sahal bin Hunaif ko paaya. Hazrat Abu-Talha ney eik aadmi ko hukm diya ke unkey nichey sey namat (dari) nikal ley. Sahal ney un sey kaha : kyon nikaltey ho? unhoney farmaya : kyonkey us mein tasweeren hain. aur unkey barey mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney wo farmaya hai jo tumhen malum hai us ney kaha : kya unhoney nahin farmaya : siwa kapdey mein naqsh key? us ney kaha : ji han, lekin ye merey dil ko ziyada achchha lagta hai."
"5350","Hazrat Abu-Talha sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : farishtey us ghar mein dakhil nahin hotey jis mein tasweer ho. Busr ney farmaya : phir Zaid bimar huye to hum unki ayadat ko gaey. phir unkey darwazey par eik parda tha jis mein tasweer thi. mainey Ubedullah Khaulani sey kaha : kya Zaid ney hamen tasweer key barey mein pehley din khabar nahin di thi? Ubedullah ney kaha : kya tum ney usey ye kehtey nahin suna : siwa kapdey mein naqsh key."
"5351","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke mainey khana banaya aur Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko dawat di. aap aaye aur andar dakhil huye. phir aap ney tasweeron wala parda dekha to bahar nikal aaye aur farmaya : farishtey us ghar mein dakhil nahin hotey jis mein tasweeren hon."
"5352","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) bahar gaey phir andar aaye jabkey mainey paron waley ghodayon wali tasweeron wala parda latkaya hua tha. phir jab aap ney usey dekha to farmaya : usey utaar do."
"5353","Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki biwi Hazrat Aaisha sey riwayat hai ke unhoney farmaya : ghar key darwazey par hamara eik parda tha jis mein parindey ki tasweer thi. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : aey Aaisha ! usey hata do. kyonkey jab main andar aata hun aur usey dekhta hun to mujhey dunya yaad aati hai."
"5354","Hazrat Qasim Hazrat Aaisha sey riwayat kartey hain ke unhoney farmaya : merey ghar mein eik kapda tha jis mein tasweeren thin. mainey usey ghar key taaq mein rakh diya. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) uski taraf namaz padhtey they. phir farmaya : aey Aaisha ! usey mujh sey hata do. phir mainey usey utaar diya aur uskey takiye bana liye."
"5355","Hazrat Aaisha sey riwayat hai ke unhoney tasweeron wala parda latkaya. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) andar aaye aur usey utaar diya. phir unhoney usey kaat kar do takiye bana liye. majlis mein us waqt eik aadmi tha jisey Rabeea bin Ata kaha jata tha : mainey Abu-Muhammad yani Qasim sey suna majlis mein us waqt eik aadmi tha jisey Rabeea bin Ata kaha jata tha : mainey Abu-Muhammad yani Qasim sey suna jo Hazrat Aaisha sey riwayat kartey they, unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) un dono par tek lagaya kartey they."
"5356","Hazrat Aaisha sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) safar sey tashrif laye jabkey mainey apney taaq par tasweeron wala parda latkaya hua tha. aap ney usey utaar diya aur farmaya : qiyamat key din sab sey sakht azaab un logon ko hoga jo Allah ki takhleeq jaisa banatey hain."
"5357","Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki biwi Hazrat Aaisha sey riwayat hai ke unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) merey paas andar aaye jabkey mainey tasweeron wala parda latkaya hua tha. phir jab aap ney usey dekha to aap ka chehra mutaghayyar ho gaya. phir aap ney usey apney haath sey phaad diya aur farmaya : qiyamat key din sab sey sakht azaab un logon ko hoga jo Allah ki takhleeq jaisa banatey hain."
"5358","Hazrat Nazar bin Anas sey riwayat hai ke main Hazrat ibne-Abbas key paas betha tha. Iraq walon mein sey eik aadmi aaya aur bola : main ye tasweeren banata hun. is barey mein kya farmatey hain? unhoney farmaya : qareeb aao, qareeb aao. mainey Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : jo shakhs dunya mein tasweer banayega usey qiyamat key din paband kiya jaeyga ke us mein rooh phunkhey. aur wo phunkney wala nahin."
"5359","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs tasweer banayega usey azaab diya jaeyga yahan tak ke usey paband kiya jaeyga ke us mein rooh phunkhey. aur wo phunkney wala nahin."
"5360","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs (jaandaar ki) tasweer banayega usey qiyamat key din paband kiya jaeyga ke us mein rooh phunkhey. aur wo phunkney wala nahin."
"5361","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : in tasweeren bananey walon ko qiyamat key din azaab diya jaeyga. unhen kaha jaeyga ke jo tum ney tasweeren banain un mein jaan daalo."
"5362","Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki biwi Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : yaqinan in tasweeren bananey walon ko qiyamat key din azaab diya jaeyga. aur unhen kaha jaeyga ke jo tum ney banaya hai us mein jaan daalo."
"5363","Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki biwi Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) ney farmaya : be-shak qiyamat key din sab sey ziyada azaab un logon ko hoga jo (tasweeren bana kar) paida karney mein Allah ki naqqali kartey hain."
"5364","Hazrat Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : be-shak qiyamat key din sab sey ziyada azaab un logon ko hoga jo (jaandaar chizon ki) tasweeren banatey hain."
"5365","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Hazrat Jibraeel (Alaihissalam) ney Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey andar aaney ki ijazat talabi. aap ney farmaya : aa jaen. unhoney kaha : main kaisey aaun jabkey aap key ghar mein tasweeron wala parda hai? ya to unkey sar kaat diye jaeyn, ya unhen farsh ki chatai bana diya jaey jisey raunda jaey. kyonkey hum farishton ki jamaat us ghar mein dakhil nahin hoti jis mein tasweeren hon."
"5366","Ummul-Mominin Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) hamarey lihaafon mein namaz nahin padhtey they. Sufiyan ney (lihaaf) ki bajaey (mulahhaf) key alfaz bayan kiye hain."
"5367","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki jutiyon key do tasmey they."
"5368","Hazrat Amr bin Aus sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki jutiyon key do tasmey they."
"5369","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab tum mein sey kisi ki juti ka tasma toot jaey to wo eik juti pehen kar na chaley yahan tak ke usey theek kar ley."
"5370","Hazrat Abu-Razeen bayan kartey hain ke mainey Hazrat Abu-Hurera ko dekha wo apna haath apney maathey par (bataur taajjub aur afsos) maar rahey they aur farma rahey they : aey Iraqiyon ! tum samajhtey ho ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka naam ley kar jhoot bol raha hun? main gawahi deta hun ke mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : jab tum mein sey kisi shakhs key jutey ka tasma toot jaey to wo dusra (eik) juta pehen kar na chaley yahan tak ke usey theek kar ley."
"5371","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) chamdey key bichhoney par aaram farma huye. aap ko paseena aa gaya. (meri maan) Hazrat Ummey Sulaim ney aap ka paseena pochh kar sheeshi mein jama kar liya. Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney unhen dekha. farmaya : ye tum kya kar rahi ho, aey Ummey Sulaim? unhoney kaha : main aap ka paseena apney itr mein daal rahi hun. aur Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) hans diye."
"5372","Hazrat Samura bin Saham sey riwayat hai ke main Hazrat Abu-Hashim bin Utba (Raziallahu anhu) ka mehmaan bana. unko taoon ki bimari lahiq ho chuki thi. Hazrat Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) unki ayadat key liye aaye. Abu-Hashim roye. Muawiya ney farmaya : tumhen kya rula raha hai? kya dard jo tumhen bechain karta hai, ya dunya (key janey) par jabkey uski umdagi ja chuki? unhoney farmaya : dono nahin. lekin Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mujh sey ahad liya tha. meri khwahish thi ke kaash main uski pairwi karta. unhoney farmaya : tum anqareeb aise amwaal paogey jo logon mein taqseem kiye jaengey. aur tumhen us mein sey sirf khadim aur Allah ki raah mein sawari hi kaafi hai. phir mainey (maal) paaya to jama kar liya."
"5373","Hazrat Abu-Umama bin Sahal (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki talwar key dastey key kinarey par chaandi lagi thi."
"5374","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki talwar ka naal chaandi ka tha. uskey dastey key kinarey par bhi chaandi lagi thi aur darmiyan mein bhi chaandi key halqey baney they."
"5375","Hazrat Saeed bin Abi Al-Hasan sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki talwar ka dasta chaandi ka tha."
"5376","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mujh sey farmaya : tu ye dua kiya kar (Allahumma saddidni wa hdini) aey Allah ! mujhey seedha rakhna aur hidayat par qayem rakhna. aur mujhey mayasir par bethney sey mana farmaya. aur mayasir : qassi hai jisey aurten apney khawindon key liye kajawey par qataaef ki tarah banati thin jo urjuwan (surkh) hota tha."
"5377","Hazrat Abu-Rifaa (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huwa jabkey aap khitab farma rahey they. mainey kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! eik ajnabi aadmi aaya hai jo apney Deen key barey mein puchhta hai. wo nahin janta ke uska Deen kya hai? phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) meri taraf mutawajjah huye aur apna khutba chhod diya yahan tak ke merey paas pahunchey. phir aap key liye kursi laee gaee. mera khayal hai ke mera khayal hai ke uskey paaye lohey key they. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) us par beth gaey aur mujhey Allah key sikhaye mein sey sikhlaaney lagey. phir apney khutbey par aaye aur usey pura kiya."
"5378","Hazrat Abu-Juhaifa (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain ke hum Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key sath Batha Makka mein they jabkey aap surkh rang key eik khemey mein tashrif farma they aur aap key paas kuchh log they. phir aap key paas Hazrat Bilal aaye. unhoney azan kahi aur apna munh idhar udhar phertey rahey."
